1
00:00:11,365 --> 00:00:14,452
FROM ME TO YOU 2ND SEASON

2
00:01:01,082 --> 00:01:02,458
FROM NOW ON

3
00:01:08,339 --> 00:01:10,925
Whoa, is it really that late already?

4
00:01:11,759 --> 00:01:17,223
Man... I guess time flew by while we
were working. None of us even noticed.

5
00:01:18,974 --> 00:01:20,851
Are you doing okay, Sawako?

6
00:01:21,852 --> 00:01:25,773
Don't forget that you're the one doing
the solo performance in the costume march

7
00:01:25,856 --> 00:01:29,527
too. So just make
sure you get some sleep.

8
00:01:33,864 --> 00:01:35,032
I don't mind.

9
00:01:36,158 --> 00:01:39,703
Even if I weren't doing this, I
wouldn't be able to sleep tonight.

10
00:01:39,787 --> 00:01:41,789
Got any extra marking pins?

11
00:01:41,872 --> 00:01:42,998
Uh... Yeah!

12
00:01:49,171 --> 00:01:55,928
- Sawako, your cell phone's blinking.
- Oh, you're right. Maybe it's my dad...

13
00:02:05,146 --> 00:02:07,815
It's gonna be a long, long night.

14
00:02:25,875 --> 00:02:27,459
Wait, you like him?!

15
00:02:28,460 --> 00:02:30,838
You've got a crush on Andy, Yui?!

16
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:33,174
You should just go for it!

17
00:02:33,257 --> 00:02:35,092
Yeah, Andy is a nice guy!

18
00:02:35,176 --> 00:02:36,844
- Ahh! I'm so embarrassed!
- Ask him out!

19
00:02:36,927 --> 00:02:38,637
I eavesdropped!

20
00:02:39,763 --> 00:02:43,392
I'm making Yusuke see if he can find
out if Andy has feelings for you, too!

21
00:02:43,475 --> 00:02:46,770
Sadako, do you think
they'd be a good match?

22
00:02:48,022 --> 00:02:50,858
Please... Be honest, kay?

23
00:02:52,610 --> 00:02:54,528
My honest thoughts...

24
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:04,246
You... You'd be... great!

25
00:03:05,039 --> 00:03:06,874
Yeah... The perfect couple!

26
00:03:09,501 --> 00:03:11,003
Wouldn't they be?!

27
00:03:11,212 --> 00:03:14,965
Cheering and Excited Chatter)
See? You two are compatible!

28
00:03:15,049 --> 00:03:18,844
- Wait... I, um...
- Sadako of the black magic café approves!

29
00:03:18,928 --> 00:03:20,596
- Oh no... That was irresponsible!
- I knew it! I had a feeling it'd work out!

30
00:03:20,679 --> 00:03:21,680
I think...

31
00:03:23,849 --> 00:03:26,310
I am gonna try... to say something.

32
00:03:35,694 --> 00:03:38,656
I bet that she's
transferring some of her power to you!

33
00:03:38,739 --> 00:03:41,825
- That's so nice of her!
- That's not it...

34
00:03:41,909 --> 00:03:43,619
She's extremely empathetic.

35
00:03:44,578 --> 00:03:47,748
Oh man... So it's tomorrow, huh?

36
00:03:49,375 --> 00:03:52,461
- We've sure come a long way.
- I bet Kazehaya's probably dying to get

37
00:03:52,544 --> 00:03:55,589
in touch with her and totally frustrated.

38
00:04:04,682 --> 00:04:08,894
Why are we stuck here
making this stupid float today?!

39
00:04:08,978 --> 00:04:12,773
Because tomorrow's the
costume march, remember?

40
00:04:12,856 --> 00:04:16,694
And we haven't made as much
progress as we should have.

41
00:04:16,777 --> 00:04:19,530
Well, if Joe hadn't messed up
on the all the wood measurements...

42
00:04:19,613 --> 00:04:22,366
- Oh yeah, sorry 'bout that!
- Over... and over...

43
00:04:25,035 --> 00:04:27,913
I replay that same scene in my head.

44
00:04:34,795 --> 00:04:36,463
Just to be sure...

45
00:04:37,798 --> 00:04:41,468
That all of this...
isn't some kind of dream.

46
00:04:41,552 --> 00:04:44,138
FROM: SHOTA KAZEHAYA
LET'S TALK ONCE MORE

47
00:04:55,983 --> 00:04:58,736
FROM: SAWAKO KURONUMA
OKAY

48
00:05:08,996 --> 00:05:11,498
Day two of the school festival.

49
00:05:16,503 --> 00:05:19,506
- Oh, Chizu, you're finished?
- Yup, just lookin' for my snake.

50
00:05:19,590 --> 00:05:22,051
Hey, where's Sadako?

51
00:05:23,052 --> 00:05:27,014
Uh... Yano-chin's still getting her ready.

52
00:05:27,598 --> 00:05:31,643
Now, open your eyes really
wide. Good. You're all finished!

53
00:05:32,936 --> 00:05:35,314
Hey! How's it goin'?

54
00:05:35,397 --> 00:05:36,231
Take a look.

55
00:05:39,151 --> 00:05:44,281
- I mean, have you seen all the girls?
- Yeah, their costumes are hilarious!

56
00:05:44,573 --> 00:05:48,911
- Aw, yours is really cute!
- Thanks!

57
00:05:57,628 --> 00:05:59,296
Is... something wrong?

58
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:04,551
Uh, sorry! Just had to
check that you had legs.

59
00:06:04,635 --> 00:06:08,180
I really wanted to use blush or glitter,
but I decided to go with making a strong

60
00:06:08,263 --> 00:06:11,809
- first impression instead.
- I hear that you're the Okiku

61
00:06:11,892 --> 00:06:15,396
- of The Dish Mansion at Banchō.
- Takahashi!

62
00:06:16,563 --> 00:06:19,233
She's related to wells too, isn't she?
Just like your namesake is. By that I mean

63
00:06:19,316 --> 00:06:20,317
"Sadako"

64
00:06:24,613 --> 00:06:27,991
An ugly love-hate drama about a man
who couldn't be trusted and a woman who

65
00:06:28,075 --> 00:06:31,370
eventually becomes enraged
by his untrustworthiness.

66
00:06:31,495 --> 00:06:34,665
Is that how the story goes?

67
00:06:34,748 --> 00:06:38,043
Some seem to think so.
It's a pretty juicy role.

68
00:06:38,127 --> 00:06:41,755
Oh! By the way, that
mustache looks amazing on you!

69
00:06:43,090 --> 00:06:47,010
I'm glad that the float and all
the costumes got finished in time.

70
00:06:47,094 --> 00:06:50,722
Hold on... Why are you the
one who looks tired, Ryu?

71
00:06:50,806 --> 00:06:54,476
- Because I'm going through a growth spurt.
- So, they're doing the Seven Dwarfs,

72
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:58,522
- huh? Class C's got some good taste!
- Hey.

73
00:06:58,605 --> 00:07:00,441
Is this how you wear it?

74
00:07:00,524 --> 00:07:02,568
I dunno. You gotta improvise.

75
00:07:03,235 --> 00:07:04,069
Yano!

76
00:07:04,486 --> 00:07:09,992
- Tell me, how's my talisman getup?!
- Oh uh... it's perfect! Perfectly stupid...

77
00:07:11,243 --> 00:07:12,619
Awww, ya mean iiit?!

78
00:07:13,203 --> 00:07:17,541
- Uhhhh you're a martial artist, right?
- Nuh-uh! I'm a snake type!

79
00:07:17,624 --> 00:07:19,042
- You look good in that.
- The front's all weird.

80
00:07:19,126 --> 00:07:22,212
- Oh, you think so?
- Yano.

81
00:07:23,755 --> 00:07:26,300
- Where's Kuronuma?
- She was chatting in the

82
00:07:26,383 --> 00:07:29,052
- hallway with Chigusa last I saw.
- Thanks.

83
00:07:29,136 --> 00:07:30,262
Kazehaya.

84
00:07:33,515 --> 00:07:37,352
Y'know that costume you're
wearing? It was sewn by her.

85
00:07:41,857 --> 00:07:45,527
Come on! It's time to get your butts in
gear! -If you're ready to get going, then

86
00:07:45,611 --> 00:07:49,239
head outside and start
lining up! -That's odd.

87
00:07:49,323 --> 00:07:50,282
Huh? What?

88
00:07:50,365 --> 00:07:51,909
Where'd Kuronuma go?

89
00:07:51,992 --> 00:07:55,204
If you're looking for her
she's already out there.

90
00:07:55,287 --> 00:07:58,874
Ah okay, thanks. Why
is he in such a hurry?

91
00:07:58,957 --> 00:08:00,792
Off to get rejected again?

92
00:08:00,876 --> 00:08:03,378
If you think I care, I don't. Sorry!

93
00:08:04,713 --> 00:08:10,344
Wait... He looked so vibrant
and full of life just now!

94
00:08:10,427 --> 00:08:13,138
How is that possible when he was so
down in the dumps not that long ago!

95
00:08:13,222 --> 00:08:15,807
- What's it to you?
- Can you move?

96
00:08:26,944 --> 00:08:30,614
Listen, just do your best for your solo.

97
00:08:30,697 --> 00:08:35,744
I bet you anything Shota
would say the same thing.

98
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:40,874
Kuronuma!

99
00:08:57,975 --> 00:09:01,562
This is why... I wanna
hide you from everyone.

100
00:09:03,814 --> 00:09:05,774
Thanks a lot for the message.

101
00:09:07,693 --> 00:09:09,861
I, uh no, thank you.

102
00:09:10,946 --> 00:09:13,240
Kazehaya! Do you think all the girls in
school will dig me if I hop around while

103
00:09:13,323 --> 00:09:15,867
- I'm wearing this?
- Hey, just give me a second.

104
00:09:15,951 --> 00:09:17,828
This is tiring...

105
00:09:20,414 --> 00:09:23,125
Yeah sorry. I'm talking to Kuronuma.

106
00:09:26,378 --> 00:09:28,338
NAMU AMIDA BUTSU

107
00:09:32,926 --> 00:09:35,512
Huh? What's up guys...?

108
00:09:37,306 --> 00:09:40,559
Kuronuma, I wanna tell you again.

109
00:09:42,728 --> 00:09:44,313
And I wanna say it right.

110
00:09:50,152 --> 00:09:50,986
Um...

111
00:09:54,072 --> 00:09:59,328
But do you mind if I say
what I have to say first?

112
00:10:01,622 --> 00:10:04,583
Please... before my courage runs out...

113
00:10:07,961 --> 00:10:13,133
I was... happy to be with you at
the shrine, on New Years Eve.

114
00:10:15,469 --> 00:10:18,680
To be honest... really
happy and it scared me.

115
00:10:24,102 --> 00:10:28,649
There was one side of me that wanted to
make you all mine but the other side

116
00:10:28,732 --> 00:10:33,236
didn't want to risk
being disliked by you.

117
00:10:36,740 --> 00:10:41,286
If I share my feelings with
him, it could change everything.

118
00:10:42,329 --> 00:10:43,580
Then again...

119
00:10:45,540 --> 00:10:49,836
I really... would like to form a new
relationship with you, Kazehaya.

120
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:54,257
From now on, We'll both be starting over!

121
00:10:58,679 --> 00:11:01,848
I think... whatever comes out of this...

122
00:11:05,477 --> 00:11:09,690
Because it's with
Kazehaya, then I'm sure... I'm sure...

123
00:11:14,403 --> 00:11:15,487
Gather round!

124
00:11:18,990 --> 00:11:19,950
Please watch me.

125
00:11:21,451 --> 00:11:22,911
I'll do my best.

126
00:11:25,580 --> 00:11:29,584
There are so many things in my life that
have changed after having met you. Using

127
00:11:29,668 --> 00:11:33,672
all of my experiences from the past
year, I'm going to give the most vengeful

128
00:11:33,755 --> 00:11:35,841
performance ever!

129
00:11:37,843 --> 00:11:40,887
I'll do what I can to
help our class win this!

130
00:11:54,693 --> 00:11:59,573
When I realized I liked
Kazehaya... I noticed a change in myself.

131
00:12:08,415 --> 00:12:09,541
Kuronuma!

132
00:12:20,552 --> 00:12:21,470
I like you!

133
00:12:53,251 --> 00:12:55,962
NIGHT PARADE OF DEMONS

134
00:13:16,942 --> 00:13:18,568
Hey, tell me.

135
00:13:19,152 --> 00:13:21,071
Just now... What
exactly do you mean by that?

136
00:13:21,154 --> 00:13:23,031
A-A compliment!

137
00:13:27,452 --> 00:13:28,328
I want...

138
00:13:28,912 --> 00:13:31,498
...to be... closer with everyone.

139
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:55,313
I'll try my best to become
friends... with both of them!

140
00:14:00,402 --> 00:14:02,153
AROMA HABO TEA

141
00:14:09,911 --> 00:14:12,998
I mean it. I don't
need you to be my savior.

142
00:14:14,833 --> 00:14:15,500
Alright?

143
00:14:18,461 --> 00:14:19,838
TETSURYUKEN

144
00:14:56,041 --> 00:14:58,084
Next up... will be Class 2-D.

145
00:15:11,097 --> 00:15:12,432
Number one...

146
00:15:14,809 --> 00:15:16,019
And number two...

147
00:15:18,688 --> 00:15:20,440
Ah... my prized plates...

148
00:15:27,530 --> 00:15:32,077
No matter how many times I
count, there's always one missing...

149
00:15:35,789 --> 00:15:37,582
Now's the time! Do it!

150
00:15:52,597 --> 00:15:53,473
TSUBUKO

151
00:15:55,475 --> 00:16:00,897
I've kept them cooled, so they're as
cold as ice. I hope you enjoy them...

152
00:16:01,856 --> 00:16:05,819
- Do you think these are bribes?
- What else could they be?

153
00:16:05,902 --> 00:16:08,738
Can you... stop staring? It's scary.

154
00:16:35,682 --> 00:16:40,478
Ah, hello everyone. After such an eventful
day, it's time to begin the 43rd Kitahoro

155
00:16:40,562 --> 00:16:45,150
High School Festival's closing ceremony.

156
00:16:45,900 --> 00:16:49,779
To start off, we will
announce each divisions' rankings.

157
00:16:49,863 --> 00:16:52,949
1st place in the hallway flier division...

158
00:16:53,575 --> 00:16:56,578
...is Class 3-B with their Wild West theme!

159
00:16:58,580 --> 00:17:03,334
And 1st place in the food
stand division goes to... Class 2-D!

160
00:17:06,671 --> 00:17:10,091
The black magic consultation's high
popularity put them at a solid 1st place!

161
00:17:10,175 --> 00:17:13,386
Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko!
Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko!

162
00:17:13,470 --> 00:17:16,848
- Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko!
- Next up... the results

163
00:17:16,931 --> 00:17:19,434
of the costume march.

164
00:17:19,517 --> 00:17:22,062
We've got this in the bag!

165
00:17:22,771 --> 00:17:26,566
Now, unfortunately for Class 2-D, the
drinks served to the judges during their

166
00:17:26,649 --> 00:17:30,445
performance have been determined to be
bribery. Therefore, Class 2-D earned zero

167
00:17:30,528 --> 00:17:34,115
points for the costume march.

168
00:17:38,453 --> 00:17:40,997
- What?
- Thanks for understanding.

169
00:17:43,750 --> 00:17:47,128
Now, the moment we've all been
waiting for, it's time to announce the

170
00:17:47,212 --> 00:17:50,632
- total ranking!
- Are you kidding me?!

171
00:17:50,715 --> 00:17:55,220
Screw all that! Now you listen to me...
Ulterior motives... come straight from the

172
00:17:55,303 --> 00:17:56,137
heart!

173
00:17:56,971 --> 00:17:59,099
The class that came out on top
for this year's Grand Prize is...

174
00:17:59,182 --> 00:18:01,351
Fatty tuna! Sea urchin!

175
00:18:02,936 --> 00:18:03,728
Abaloneee!

176
00:18:09,442 --> 00:18:12,112
So, we ended up in 6th place at the end.

177
00:18:12,278 --> 00:18:15,031
But we were 1st place
among the 2nd-year classes.

178
00:18:15,115 --> 00:18:17,700
We were actually pretty close.

179
00:18:17,784 --> 00:18:21,079
If there weren't bribes, we
could've placed on the costume march too.

180
00:18:21,162 --> 00:18:24,457
Yeah, since Sadako's
acting was so spot on!

181
00:18:25,333 --> 00:18:30,421
- The after-party'll be at the usual place.
- Good to know. Sawako.

182
00:18:59,325 --> 00:19:01,452
They're not different.

183
00:19:01,536 --> 00:19:03,746
They're the same, aren't they?

184
00:19:07,292 --> 00:19:10,128
I kept thinking, "It can't be."

185
00:19:10,211 --> 00:19:15,592
But deep down, there was little one
possibility I could never cross out.

186
00:19:17,051 --> 00:19:17,969
I like you!

187
00:19:33,151 --> 00:19:35,236
I want all of it...

188
00:19:37,614 --> 00:19:40,325
I... I want everything, Kazehaya.

189
00:19:55,048 --> 00:19:55,924
Me too.

190
00:20:09,437 --> 00:20:10,688
It's like a dream.

191
00:20:15,276 --> 00:20:17,445
They finally reached you.

192
00:21:12,834 --> 00:21:15,128
I like you more than anyone.

193
00:22:27,492 --> 00:22:29,285
His blushing face...

194
00:22:29,869 --> 00:22:31,579
The faint sea breeze...

195
00:22:32,580 --> 00:22:35,083
Next time: "After the Festival"
